# Who am I?

Hi! I'm OJ Rodriquez (He/Him), but online I tend to go by PlasmaOJ15 (I got this username as a kid and never bothered to change it).

I'm a 20 year old Computer Science student at the University of Arizona, with a minor in Game Development. I have interests in basically all things tech.
I've played around with programming, game development, video production, music production, VR, 3D modeling, 3D printing, and probably more I cannot remember.

PlasmaOJ15, the "brand," is basically the label all of my projects fall under, and started when I was about 10 years old and started experimenting with stop motion.

# What is this website?

This website was basically created to be a place for me to show off all my projects in one place. Plus, its cool to just have a website. It was also created to have
a place to experiment with ideas I have. While there will never be any sort of ARG or elaborate story for this website (as of now, this is up to change), I do plan
to have secrets and easter eggs hidden throughout the site.

